---
import Link from "@/components/Link.astro";
---

<section>
  <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint">
    fiatcode <span class="text-phosphor">&mdash;</span> cross-platform
    developer
  </p>

  <h1 class="text-display mt-5 font-serif font-semibold text-ink">
    I build cross-platform apps and
    <em class="text-phosphor">write about what breaks.</em>
  </h1>

  <div
    class="mt-7 max-w-prose space-y-5 font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-dim [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_strong]:text-ink"
  >
    <p>
      I&rsquo;m a developer at a local startup, where a typical day moves
      between Flutter, Spring, and React Router&mdash;sometimes all three
      before lunch. This blog is where I keep the notes I wish I had found:
      real fixes, walkthroughs, and the occasional opinion about doing the
      work properly.
    </p>
    <p>
      I care about tests, clear boundaries, and software that respects the
      person using it. If something here saves you an hour at 2am, it did
      its job.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-line-soft pt-6 font-mono text-sm"
  >
    <Link href="/posts" class="group"
      >read the posts
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"
        >&rarr;</span
      ></Link
    >
    <span class="text-ink-faint">or</span>
    <Link href="/tags">browse by tag</Link>
  </div>
</section>
